======================================================================================================================
RAW vs CONDITIONAL -- Spearman of MAE against MFE
======================================================================================================================
  raw  = ranks of the realised MAE and MFE themselves: the path's
         arithmetic, before any feature.
  PIT  = ranks of each episode's position in its own QTREE
         distribution: what is left after the features.
  Negative = the excursions trade off (shared endpoint). Positive =
  they move together (shared volatility). Near zero can be cancellation
  of the two, so it is not evidence of independence.

